Copy this file to deploy/.env and replace both secrets.

Never commit deploy/.env.

LOCUSTA_SECRET=REPLACE_WITH_FIRST_RANDOM_SECRET
LOCUSTA_JWT_SECRET=REPLACE_WITH_SECOND_RANDOM_SECRET
LOCUSTA_ADMIN_PASS=REPLACE_WITH_A_STRONG_UNIQUE_PASSWORD

Optional AI integration

LOCUSTA_AI_ENABLED=false
LOCUSTA_AI_KEY=

Keep autonomous execution disabled by default.

LOCUSTA_AUTO_EXECUTE=false